SUMMARY:THRUST FEST
DESCRIPTION:THRUST FEST is a brand new drag festival highlighting the brilliance\, elegance\, talent\, and star power of Drag Kings! The show festival nights will be held July 24-26\, 2026 at Factory Theatre. Three nights of shows\, two days of workshops\, one drag king festival! \n\n\n\nInternational team Riley Poppyseed\, Kreme Inakuchi\, and Throb Zombie have banded together to bring you an incredible summer weekend full of showcases\, competition\, education\, and TALENT. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHEADLINERS\n\n\n\nHercuSleaze\, Jarvis Hammer\, Yuen Young\, Riley Poppyseed\, Kreme Inakuchi\, Throb Zombie \n\n\n\nHOSTS\n\n\n\nJarvis Hammer\, Throb Zombie\, Pressure K\, SHERMAN\, Ivory \n\n\n\nSTAGE MANAGER\n\n\n\nRoo Macaraeg \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPERFORMERS\n\n\n\n\n\nNIGHT ONE \n\n\n\nHoliday KingsLuciano VeriNottiShayne NashFreddy Prinze CharmingAngus BeefConnor Ria!King FreddieSir MaximDanny Fox-Trot & Logan LiqueurPrecious JulzChey BoiCyrus K. StrattonPølterguyHarley SayneSpank KnightlyTuna MeltBenedick the BastardDeVery BessMaximum CapacityCyril Cinder \n\n\n\n\n\nNIGHT TWO \n\n\n\nSon of a ButchEl ExperimentoKurt CumstainG WizFlareHennessy WilliamsBuck WyldeThe Twisted TransitionerHeehaw the Drag DonkeySid SeedyVERA!TyquanRandy RoyKing Amari MarsallisHenlo BullfrogJack King GoffAbel N. WillingThe Bicount Boops BoopsCraven BloodSkirt CocaineClay Taurus \n\n\n\n\n\nNIGHT THREE \n\n\n\nWisteria KnellHawkeye FierceRobin WoodMisterrrPapi ChurroMars Violet Basqui’notAnna ShevitzThe Backstreet ButchesDouglas FurStefan FetameanAce MonsteraManny DingoGay JesusAdam AppleGwenitaliaBj Stroker \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n120 minutes /18+ / flashing lights / very loud noises / haze / mature content / adult themes / partial nudity \n\n\n\nFriday\, July 24th: 7 pm Doors / 8 pm – 10:30 show \n\n\n\nSaturday\, July 25th: 7 pm Doors / 8 pm – 10:30 show \n\n\n\nSunday\, July 26th: 7 pm Doors / 8 pm – 10:30 show \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFRIDAY TICKETS\n\n\n\nSATURDAY TICKETS\n\n\n\nSUNDAY TICKETS
